window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-040-1f55bca32931a217.json"]={sha256:"1f55bca32931a217be255af2b0a3bcfef9ff4522cf928387291831f6a85f10de",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-00ba2798b5939dac","url":"https://github.com/notaryproject/specifications/blob/main/specs/trust-store-trust-policy.md","title":"Notary Project trust store and trust policy specification","titleEn":"Notary Project trust store and trust policy specification","publisher":"Notary Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-040","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-040","related":[{"id":"security-v27-041","referenceUrls":["https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/source-date-epoch/"],"title":"SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH：UTC、封存時間下限與決定性","titleEn":"SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH: UTC, archive timestamp floors and determinism","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：58.333%與66.667%可重算，未匹配scope與錯身分仍拒絕；沒有捏造多簽門檻功能。 交付notation-policy-matrix.json、近似倉庫負例與信任store來源表；不對正式registry上傳簽章。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce approximately 58.333 and 66.667 percent and reject unmatched scopes and wrong identities, without inventing native multisignature quorum behavior. Deliver notation-policy-matrix.json, similar-repository counterexamples and the trust-store provenance table. The exercise uploads no signatures to a production registry.","difference":"建立三個相同內容的本地封存實驗，改變牆鐘、時區與來源時間；逐項保存檔案順序、權限、時間欄及內容摘要。","differenceEn":"Build three local archives with identical contents while varying wall clock, timezone and source epoch. Record entry ordering, permissions, timestamp fields and content digests, separating metadata differences from actual changes in the payload.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課要求命中預期倉庫政策、可信身分與指定檢查皆通過；未匹配政策不授權。此課沒有將Notation說成原生支援n-of-m多簽門檻。 12筆中10筆命中正確scope，當中7筆身分與驗證要求全符合；其他列保留無政策、錯身分或過期等具體原因。 完整通過率7/12×100≈58.333%；修正一筆scope已正確但信任store選錯的設定後為8/12×100≈66.667%。","本課ZIP實作採1980-01-01 UTC為下限315532800；有效時間取max(來源epoch,下限)，這是特定封存格式的轉換，不可回寫改變原始來源歷史。 來源epoch=300000000秒，ZIP下限315532800；本課只計因格式限制而增加的秒數，不宣稱來源真實發生於1980年。 調整量max(300000000,315532800)−300000000=15532800秒；來源改320000000時調整量0。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The local gate requires the intended repository policy, trusted identity and configured checks to pass. No matching policy means no approval. This exercise does not claim that the Notary trust-policy model natively supplies an n-of-m signature quorum. Ten of 12 artifacts match the correct scope, and seven of those satisfy identity and verification requirements. Preserve concrete reasons such as no policy, wrong signer or expired evidence rather than combining them into one ambiguous failure. Full acceptance is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Repairing one correctly scoped artifact with the wrong selected trust store yields 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent, without widening repository scope.","For the selected ZIP implementation use the 1980-01-01 UTC floor of 315532800. Effective timestamp is max(source epoch,floor), a format conversion that must not rewrite the original source history or be generalized to every archive format. Set source epoch to 300000000 seconds with ZIP floor 315532800. Calculate only the adjustment required by this representation, without claiming that the original source event actually occurred at the adjusted archive timestamp. Adjustment is max(300000000, 315532800)−300000000=15532800 seconds. With source epoch 320000000 the adjustment is zero, because the source already lies above the representation floor.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-050","referenceUrls":["https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-reproducible-builds.html"],"title":"Apache Maven：輸出時間、外掛相容與獨立重建差異","titleEn":"Apache Maven: output timestamps, plugin compatibility and independent rebuilds","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：58.333%與66.667%可重算，未匹配scope與錯身分仍拒絕；沒有捏造多簽門檻功能。 交付notation-policy-matrix.json、近似倉庫負例與信任store來源表；不對正式registry上傳簽章。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce approximately 58.333 and 66.667 percent and reject unmatched scopes and wrong identities, without inventing native multisignature quorum behavior. Deliver notation-policy-matrix.json, similar-repository counterexamples and the trust-store provenance table. The exercise uploads no signatures to a production registry.","difference":"建立12個模組產物對，記錄JDK、Maven、外掛版本、outputTimestamp與工作路徑；保留參考產物，不讓第二次建置覆蓋比較基準。","differenceEn":"Build 12 module-artifact pairs with JDK, Maven, plugin revisions, outputTimestamp and working paths. Preserve the reference artifacts separately so the second build cannot overwrite the baseline and manufacture an apparent comparison success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課要求命中預期倉庫政策、可信身分與指定檢查皆通過；未匹配政策不授權。此課沒有將Notation說成原生支援n-of-m多簽門檻。 12筆中10筆命中正確scope，當中7筆身分與驗證要求全符合；其他列保留無政策、錯身分或過期等具體原因。 完整通過率7/12×100≈58.333%；修正一筆scope已正確但信任store選錯的設定後為8/12×100≈66.667%。","本課以位元組完全一致的產物比例衡量重建覆蓋；固定時間只是其中一項條件，需檢查工具版本與環境外洩。不同Maven版本預設行為應依文件核對，不假設都需同一手動開關。 12對產物中8對位元組相同，2對只差封存時間，2對含工作路徑差異；四個差異案例互不重疊。 相同比例8/12×100≈66.667%；修復兩個時間差異產物後變10/12×100≈83.333%，工作路徑差異仍存在。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The local gate requires the intended repository policy, trusted identity and configured checks to pass. No matching policy means no approval. This exercise does not claim that the Notary trust-policy model natively supplies an n-of-m signature quorum. Ten of 12 artifacts match the correct scope, and seven of those satisfy identity and verification requirements. Preserve concrete reasons such as no policy, wrong signer or expired evidence rather than combining them into one ambiguous failure. Full acceptance is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Repairing one correctly scoped artifact with the wrong selected trust store yields 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent, without widening repository scope.","Measure byte-identical artifacts as rebuild coverage. Fixed time is one condition among tool versions and environment leakage. Check documented defaults for the selected Maven release rather than assuming every version requires the same manual switch. Eight of 12 artifact pairs are byte-identical, two differ only in archive timestamps and two embed different working paths. Keep the four differing cases disjoint and retain the exact byte-range or structured archive differences. Equality is 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent. Repairing the two timestamp-only artifacts gives 10/12×100, approximately 83.333 percent, while the working-path differences remain unresolved.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-908a82feae871669","url":"https://reproducible-builds.org/docs/source-date-epoch/","title":"Reproducible Builds: SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH","titleEn":"Reproducible Builds: SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH","publisher":"Reproducible Builds","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-df13fb07dd26c959","url":"https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-reproducible-builds.html","title":"Configuring for Reproducible Builds","titleEn":"Configuring for Reproducible Builds","publisher":"Apache Maven","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
